<title>POLAND: NBP sells PLN 500 mln 273-day bills at flat 22 pct.</title>
<headline>NBP sells PLN 500 mln 273-day bills at flat 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 500 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills, the amount on offer, after investors bid for 578 million zlotys worth of the bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bank sold its bills at an unchanged average yield of 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
